\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Non-RL control methods benchmarked on SiliQun \texttt  {simos\_nominal} profile, 2-qubit Bell state target, 3 seeds (42, 123, 456). All methods use the same Lindblad physics engine as the RL experiments. $\bar  {F} \pm \sigma $ = mean $\pm $ std across seeds. GRAPE and CRAB use \texttt  {qutip-qtrl} v0.1.3~\cite  {QuTiPCtrl2023}; VQE uses Qiskit Aer statevector simulator~\cite  {Qiskit2024}; BO uses GP-based Bayesian optimisation with 500 function evaluations~\cite  {Nogueira2014}; CMA-ES uses the \texttt  {cma} library~\cite  {Hansen2016}. BO and CMA-ES are run as independent optimisers; the results reported are for each method separately. Hardware: RTX~2070 Max-Q 8\,GB VRAM; total wall-clock $\approx $1.8\,h.}}{15}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
