\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Extension~4 results summary. \textbf  {(a)} Mean best fidelity $\bar  {F}_\text  {best}$ per target state (bars: mean; error bars: $\pm \sigma $; dots: individual seed values). The dashed red line marks the $F \geq 0.99$ threshold. GHZ-3 and Cluster-3 exceed the threshold across all three seeds; W-3 plateaus at $\bar  {F} = 0.8551$, below the threshold. \textbf  {(b)} Steps to best fidelity per seed. Seed~456 converges in 9{,}209 steps for GHZ/Cluster-3, roughly $6\times $ faster than seeds 42 and 123. W-state runs exhaust the full $5\times 10^5$ step budget (marked $\times $). Hardware: RTX~2070 Max-Q 8\,GB VRAM.}}{28}{figure.9}\protected@file@percent }
